menu "Station: receiver supervisor"

    config STATION_TASK_STACK
        int "Supervisor task stack (bytes)"
        range 4096 16384
        default 8192
        help
            Internal RAM (the task writes settings). Detection, the profile
            apply and the command layer's session executor run on it.
            PROVISIONAL, to be confirmed on hardware from the task's stack
            high-water mark.

    config STATION_FLASH_RESTART_ALLOWANCE_S
        int "Receiver write, restart and reacquisition allowance for an update (s)"
        range 30 900
        default 180
        help
            Added to the transfer time at the loader baud (package size,
            10 bits per byte, plus 10 %) to estimate a receiver update's
            downtime for the confirmation dialog. Information only: it never
            gates an update. Refine from measured runs.

endmenu
